  "content": "\n\n<h1>重塑 GUI - 深色版</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimaginedguidark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth 獨有 Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimaginedguidark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge 獨有 Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"AmongstReality 的 Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"AmongstReality 的 Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<p>替換遊戲中的所有容器，並變更快捷欄、心形與盔甲圖標。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>如果你正在尋找淺色版，可以在此處找到 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimaginedguilight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">重塑 GUI - 淺色版</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>你可以在這裡支持我和我的專案</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<h2>模組支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backslot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcapes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventorio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmidnightcontrols\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightControls</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fno-chat-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Chat Reports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Notebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulker Box Tooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/metal-barrels/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Metal Barrels</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>使用條款</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">版權所有 &copy; 重塑 GUI - 深色版</p>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">作者：AmongstReality</p>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">作者在不同平台上的頁面連結：</p>\n<ul style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" rel=\"nofollow\">BuyMeACoffee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">你可以使用我的素材的場合：</p>\n<ul style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<li>在 Modrinth/CurseForge 上的公開整合包中。</li>\n<li>若想為該資源包新增模組支援作為擴充功能。若如此操作，必須清楚標示來源並附上原始資源包的連結。</li>\n<li>對原始資源包進行的任何私人修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">你<strong>無法</strong>使用我的素材的場合：</p>\n<ul style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<li>在基岩版市場進行分發。</li>\n<li>設置付費牆（例如 Patreon）。</li>\n<li>在任何平台上分發原始或修改過的素材。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">該資源包在不同平台頁面的連結：</p>\n<ul style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimaginedguidark\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimaginedguidark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
